#: kdebase/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:224
msgid ""
"Name=You might want to send a bug report for this application. Check if it "
"is listed on http://bugs.kde.org, otherwise mail the author. Please include "
"as much information as possible, maybe the original documents. If you have a "
"way to reproduce the error, include this also."
msgstr ""
"Name=Anda mungkin mahu menghantar laporan ralat untuk aplikasi ini. Periksa "
"jika ia tercatat di  http://bugs.kde.org, atau terus melkan kepada "
"penulisnya. Sertakan maklumat sebanyak mungkim, seperti dokumen asal. "
"Sertakan juga cara untuk mendapatkan ralat, jika boleh."

#: kdebase/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:267
